  "description": "Waking up at 4 AM and living a perfect life with a minute-by-minute schedule. Chan-Young, an unexpected man, intrudes upon her daily routine where she never wasted a single minute or second. Due to Chan-Young, who is devoted solely to the present, Mirae's plans keep getting disrupted... Will Mirae be able to stick to her routine and to-do list?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=852611), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14451336)",
